v 3
d 'RTMTOOLS_PORTABLE': portable do-file versions of the rtmtools workflows
d
d Plain Stata do-files for the frame, listing, sampling and weighting workflows of rtmtools,
d written to be copied and adapted by another program: a parameter block at the top of each
d file, a comment above every step, an adaptation guide (ADAPTATION.md), the export helpers,
d the Excel display template, the template data the files run on, and a second synthetic
d program (adopt_test) used by the portability test. Get them with: net get rtmtools_portable.
d Companion to the rtmtools package (net install rtmtools), which the do-files do not need.
d
d KW: survey weights
d KW: sampling
d KW: phone survey
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261028
d
d Author: Real-Time Monitoring Survey Handbook task team, World Bank
d
f portable_do_files/00_setup.do
